+bytes / 141 instructions through `main+0x24f693`. The six direct calls at
+`main+0x24f48c`, `+0x24f4e4`, `+0x24f534`, `+0x24f584`, `+0x24f5d4`, and
+`+0x24f624` pass the exact literals `col_wall`, `col_water`, `col_jump`,
